## SQ-MXS-01 | mixed seeds: no load error, tags
@group A
@commands (RERUN: nested jar 2026-11-02, run plan in SQ-CDJ5) Boot; `grep -nE "mixed_seeds\|Error occurred while handling event" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log \| head`; `/dumptags` or `/kubejs`: item tags `vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants`, `forge:seeds`
@pass no error naming mixed_seeds; the plant tag holds wheat, beetroot, `farmersdelight:cabbage_seeds`, melon and pumpkin seeds; `forge:seeds` holds `vintagedelight:mixed_seeds`
@fails Unknown item: the `-10` jar is not loaded; empty tag: CD `vintagedelight/tags.js` not loaded
@from batches/r1102/b1_main.qb passed
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootreject (?i)mixed_seeds.*(error|unknown)
kjsreject (?i)mixed_seeds.*(error|unknown)
kjsreject Error occurred while handling event.*mixed_seeds
> cdevtest tag item vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants
> cdevtest tag item forge:seeds
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*.*minecraft:wheat_seeds
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*.*minecraft:beetroot_seeds
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*.*farmersdelight:cabbage_seeds
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*.*minecraft:melon_seeds
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*.*minecraft:pumpkin_seeds
expect verb=tag kind=item tag=forge:seeds .*.*vintagedelight:mixed_seeds
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-MXS-02 | mixed seeds plant mixed crops on farmland, not on grass or stone
@group A
@commands (RERUN: nested jar 2026-11-02, run plan in SQ-CDJ5) Lay 20 farmland with water; give the bot 20 `vintagedelight:mixed_seeds` in survival; it uses one on each farmland; read each block id; then use one on grass and on stone
@pass 20 crops planted, the stack empty, at least four of the five kinds (wheat, beetroots, cabbages, melon stem, pumpkin stem); grass and stone: nothing planted, seed kept (VTD-46)
@fails All one kind: the shuffle failed; seeds kept after planting: shrink missing
@from batches/r1102/b1_main.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (judge-10, 2026-11-18): fixed home 1400 -60 1400 (was {H}, the cdj5home marker capture of a CDJ5 boot 0 that this step never runs)
> forceload add 1392 1408 1431 1439
sleep 2
> fill 1400 -61 1422 1419 -61 1422 minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> fill 1400 -61 1423 1419 -61 1423 minecraft:water
> pbot spawn mx 1410 -60 1425 minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold mx vintagedelight:mixed_seeds 20
> pbot use mx 1400 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1401 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1402 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1403 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1404 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1405 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1406 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1407 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1408 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1409 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1410 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1411 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1412 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1413 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1414 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1415 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1416 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1417 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1418 -61 1422 up
> pbot use mx 1419 -61 1422 up
> cdevtest count 1400 -60 1422 1419 -60 1422 #minecraft:crops
> data get entity mx SelectedItem
expect Found no elements matching SelectedItem
expect verb=count block=#minecraft:crops n=20
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
# one more seed on grass (natural floor) and on stone: nothing planted, the seed kept
> setblock 1403 -61 1426 minecraft:stone
> pbot hold mx vintagedelight:mixed_seeds 1
> pbot use mx 1400 -61 1426 up
> pbot use mx 1403 -61 1426 up
> execute if block 1400 -60 1426 minecraft:air run say MXS02 grass stays empty
> execute if block 1403 -60 1426 minecraft:air run say MXS02 stone stays empty
> data get entity mx SelectedItem
expect MXS02 grass stays empty
expect MXS02 stone stays empty
expect has the following entity data: \{.*id: "vintagedelight:mixed_seeds"
look the verb=count ids= map: 20 crops, at least four of wheat, beetroots, farmersdelight cabbages, melon_stem, pumpkin_stem

## SQ-MXS-03 | mixed seeds from village chests and from grass (not with shears)
@group A
@commands (RERUN: nested jar 2026-11-02, run plan in SQ-CDJ5) `/loot give @p loot minecraft:chests/village/village_plains_house` 40 times and count Mixed Seeds; bot breaks 300 `minecraft:grass` with an empty hand, then 100 with shears; `grep CE/vintage_mixed_seeds_grass logs/latest.log` if LootJS logging is on
@pass some Mixed Seeds from the chest rolls (share 0.04, 1-4); about 6 from the 300 grass (2 %); none with shears (VTD-79)
@fails none from grass: the LootJS modifier did not load (CD `vintagedelight/loot.js`)
@from batches/r1102/b1_main.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
repeat 40
> loot spawn {H1+40} {H2} {H3+30} loot minecraft:chests/village/village_plains_house
end
sleep 3
> cdevtest items {H1+40} {H2+1} {H3+30} 3
> setblock {H1+40} {H2} {H3+36} minecraft:grass
repeat 300
> loot spawn {H1+40} {H2+1} {H3+38} mine {H1+40} {H2} {H3+36}
end
sleep 3
> cdevtest items {H1+40} {H2+1} {H3+38} 2
> setblock {H1+46} {H2} {H3+36} minecraft:grass
# the shears case through a bot holding shears: LootJS matchMainHand reads the player's main hand, not the /loot tool
# (r1102 judge: plain /loot mine ... minecraft:shears dropped 2 mixed seeds since no player was in the context)
> pbot spawn mxs {H1+46} {H2} {H3+34} minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold mxs minecraft:shears
repeat 100
> execute as mxs run loot spawn {H1+46} {H2+1} {H3+38} mine {H1+46} {H2} {H3+36} minecraft:shears
end
sleep 3
> cdevtest items {H1+46} {H2+1} {H3+38} 2
expect verb=items items=\S*vintagedelight:mixed_seeds:\d+
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
shell grep -hE "\[loot-drops\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | head -3; true
look the three verb=items lines in order: line 1 (chest rolls): some vintagedelight:mixed_seeds (share 0.04, 1-4); line 2 (300 empty-hand grass, /loot mine with no tool): about 6 mixed seeds; line 3 (100 with shears): grass items only, no mixed seeds
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]

